{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 4, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. As I stepped off the plane, I was immediately struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life. From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene gardens of Kyoto, I was constantly amazed by the beauty and complexity of this fascinating country.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. Watching the fishermen auction off the day's catch was a thrilling experience, and sampling some of the freshest sushi I've ever had was a culinary delight. I also had the opportunity to visit the iconic Fushimi Inari shrine in Kyoto, where thousands of vermilion torii gates form a breathtaking tunnel up the mountain.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at ease. I also appreciated the attention to detail and respect for tradition that is evident in every aspect of Japanese culture, from the intricate designs on a traditional kimono to the carefully crafted presentation of a simple meal.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a truly enriching experience that left me with a deep appreciation for this beautiful and fascinating country. I can't wait to return and explore more of what Japan has to offer.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.416728138923645}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.0032290483359247446}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20400996506214142}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.5810381770133972}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.